btype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"**Suggested board inquiries (not a mandatory approval standard):**\n\n**Selection**\n- Why this exchange and LMM? What alternatives were considered, and on what criteria (spreads, quoting obligations, fees, incentive programs)?\n- Are there conflicts, such as affiliations, revenue sharing or payments tied to the listing?\n- What exchange LMM obligations apply, and what are the performance metrics and exit or replacement terms?\n\n**Relevant-market expertise**\n- Does the LMM have demonstrated capacity to hedge and price the underlying assets (for example, foreign, fixed income, derivatives or illiquid holdings)?\n- How does it perform during stress, halts or closed underlying markets?\n- Is it an authorized participant, or does it rely on others to create and redeem?\n\n**Capital and seed**\n- How much LMM seed is planned, how long will it stay and under what redemption terms?\n- What is the expected asset level once the seed leaves?\n- How will disclosures and viability assessments avoid treating temporary market-maker seed as lasting investor demand?","ttft_ms":1329,"type":"result","duration_ms":5083,"uuid":"ac84b6b1-6ed4-47b4-b42a-ce061aa28e7f","ttft_stream_ms":1204,"time_to_request_ms":70,"first_content_frame_ms":1204,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"credential_expires_at":"2026-11-28T06:36:39.484Z"}
